Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?1203REOPEN=20stage=202:=20kCmdRingReset=20--=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?Acm=5FMasResetRing=20per=20ring,=20then=20a=20slave=20re-scan?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20+=20axis=20re-open;=20falls=20back=20to=20the=20whole-card?=
